        "   set B  file sync    (bulk)               own socket + seq",
        "   set C  chat/control                      own socket + seq",
        "B stalls on a lost packet  ->  A (the call) never notices.",
        "",
        "a 4th protocol overlays onto the least-sensitive set (B) and",
        "shares its fate \u2014 so open sets honestly, by sensitivity.",
